<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais set warrants on HK share basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais set warrants on HK share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) has issued 68 million American-style call warrants on a basket of property development stocks, lead manager Credit Lyonnais (Paris) said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share of HKR International, one share of Huey Tai International, two shares of Paliburg Holdings and two shares of Shun Tak Holdings.</p>
<p>Ten warrants for one reference basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$29.0275		PREMIUM	13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.9562		 GEARING	3.57 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	07.NOV.97		 EXP PAYDATE  25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONK KONG EXCHANGE    MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$34.15</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
